Package: webpointcloud
Version: VERSION_PLACEHOLDER
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-webkit2-4.0 | gir1.2-webkit2-4.1, libgtk-3-0
Maintainer: WebPointCloud <noreply@example.com>
Description: 3D Point Cloud Viewer & Analysis
 WebPointCloud is a desktop viewer for LAS/LAZ/PCD point clouds and
 Lanelet2 (OSM) vector maps, with measurement, cropping, and analysis
 tools. Packaged as a native desktop window (pywebview) around a
 local-only Flask backend.
